<%# Small unobtrusive corner badge for a book whose conversion failed and
    that has no deliverable Kindle-ready file — see
    Book#conversion_failed_without_deliverable?. Only rendered by callers
    that already know the answer (currently the library shelf grid), so
    this never triggers its own query. %>
<span class="cover-badge" title="A conversion failed and no Kindle-ready file is available yet">
  <span aria-hidden="true">⚠</span>
  <span class="sr-only">Conversion failed — no Kindle-ready file available</span>
</span>
